    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d116">

                <pb facs="0315" n="285" xml:id="pg285"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source"> S/S–NSC Files: Lot 63D351: NSC 45 Series<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d116-f1"/>
                </note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Report by the National Security Council to President
                        Truman </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1949-04-15">April 15, 1949</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"> NSC 45/1</p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Airfield Construction in the United Kingdom and the
                        Cairo–Suez Area</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">note by the executive secretary</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The National Security Council has considered and adopted the enclosed report on
                    the subject.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d116-f2"/>
                </p>
                <p>The National Security Council recommends that the President approve the
                    recommendation contained in paragraph 3 of the enclosed report.<anchor n="3"
                        xml:id="d116-f3"/>
                </p>
                <p>It is requested that this matter be handled with special security
                    precautions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sidney</hi> W. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Souers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>





                <xi:include href="d116-a1.xml" xpointer="d116-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d116-a2.xml" xpointer="d116-a2"/>
                <xi:include href="d116-a3.xml" xpointer="d116-a3"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d116-f1" n="1" xml:id="d116-f1-content">
                <p>Serial master files of National Security Council documentation and related
                    Department of State material for the years 1947–1961, retired by the Executive
                    Secretariat Of the Department of State.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d116-f2" n="2" xml:id="d116-f2-content">
                <p>Adopted by NSC Action No. 204, April 15, 1949 (S/S–NSC Files: Lot 66D95: NSC
                    Actions).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d116-f3" n="3" xml:id="d116-f3-content">
                <p>On April 18, President Truman approved this report and directed the Secretary of
                    State to initiate negotiations with the British Government.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
